   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT authorizing the county of Suffolk and the town of Smithtown, located in\nthe county of Suffolk, to exchange certain parklands",
    "basePrintNo": "S8048",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8048-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Suffolk County",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8048\n\nSPONSOR: MATTERA\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act authorizing the county of Suffolk and the town of Smithtown,\nlocated in the county of Suffolk, to exchange certain parklands\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo facilitate the swap of Smithtown's Bill Richards Town Park for the\nSuffolk County Paul T. Givens Park\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1,2 and 3 provide the parkland metes and bounds for each park\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation is at the request of Town of Smithtown and the Suffolk\nCounty. The Smithtown Bill Richards Town Park will be exchanged for\nSuffolk County's Paul T. Givens Park. The use of the parklands and\nfacilities will continue to be made available to the public of the state\nof New York, including all residents of the county of Suffolk and the\ntown of Smithtown.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
